<p>
  Weigh tag <strong>BOL <%= @tag.bol %></strong> between <%= @tag.sender_org.name %> (sender)
  and <%= @tag.receiver_org.name %> (receiver) is still showing a variance above tolerance.
</p>
<p>
  The dispute window closes in <strong><%= @days_left %> day<%= "s" unless @days_left == 1 %></strong>,
  on <%= @tag.clock_due_at.strftime("%b %-d, %Y %l:%M %p %Z") %>.
</p>
<p>
  If no one disputes it before then, the tag will be recorded as <em>shown, notified, and
  uncontested</em> — defaulting to the sender's recorded values. This is a neutral record of what
  happened, not a declaration that anyone agreed.
</p>
<p><%= link_to "Review the weigh tag", tag_url(@tag) %></p>
